# The games image (Dockerfile.games) needs the bot and coord folders, the vendored Kessel package and the forceteki source;
# keep the rest out, and what a local checkout builds (forceteki's packages, build and card data, caches).
# BuildKit reads this file for Dockerfile.games; fly.games.toml names it as the ignore file for flyctl.
*
!package.json
!bot
!vendor/kessel
!coord
!forceteki
forceteki/.git
forceteki/node_modules
forceteki/build
forceteki/test/json
coord/_build
coord/deps
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
